  "summary": "The studies ranked directly apply representation learning with paired positive and negative examples, a contrastive learning approach, to the task of mapping active wildfire extent. Haddad et al. [V0192], Fischer et al. [V0190], El-Sayed et al. [V0189], and Gupta et al. [V0191] all investigate this specific intersection. In contrast, Adebayo et al. [V0024] applies the same method to early prediction of septic deterioration, and is included as a lower-ranked candidate to demonstrate the method's application outside the primary topic domain.",
